{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4802-1024x786.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4837-1024x666.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4813-1024x725.jpeg\"/>\n<p>今日下午，記者一度進入排隊隊伍，當時隊列已經排到國旗及區旗桿一旁，排隊人士將紙皮鋪在地上，把鞋脫下，光着腳躺在地上，有的還準備了露營椅、雨傘、和裝有紙巾及零食等生活物資的紙皮箱，鐵欄上還有膠袋包裹着橙皮，地上也有已經氧化的蘋果芯。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4838-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4839-1024x721.jpeg\"/>\n<p>記者以排隊人士身份，詢問各排隊人士到場目的，有排隊人士原本操着一口流利的普通話，即以帶有鄉音的廣東話回答說：「排足幾日，有數千元報酬」，而且「經熟人介紹」才有機會到此排隊。記者追問實際金額及「熟人」是誰，獲回覆說：「不清楚」。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260819-YIK_4789-1024x683.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T13:53:45.000863+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":7,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}